    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s hard to find that kind of peace when just existing feels like so much work. like every morning i wake up and there's just this huge mountain of things to do and people to be, and i'm just so weary of it all. i wonder if there's a way to actually get some real, permanent rest. not just sleep, but like... actually being at peace where nothing can touch me anymore.",
